### Pariose Backend - Users API Tests
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### Get Admin Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 1. List All Users (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Search Users by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Filter Users by Role
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get User Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Specific User
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create New User (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "newvolunteer",
  "password": "Volunteer123",
  "noms": "Volunteer",
  "prenoms": "Mary",
  "contact_1": "5559876543",
  "addresse": "456 Church Avenue",
  "roleIds": [5]
}

### 7. Update User Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "noms": "Updated",
  "prenoms": "Name",
  "contact_1": "5551112222"
}

### 8. Update Own Profile (as regular user)
# First login as regular user
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "demouser",
  "password": "Demo1234"
}

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.access_token}}

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "contact_1": "5559998888"
}

### 9. Assign Roles to User (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roleIds": [5, 6]
}

### 10. Try to assign roles as regular user (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/2/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roleIds": [2]
}

### 11. Delete User (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Try to delete as regular user (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. Try to view other user's profile as regular user (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. Create User with Multiple Roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "deaconjames",
  "password": "Deacon123",
  "noms": "James",
  "prenoms": "Deacon",
  "contact_1": "5554443333",
  "roleIds": [4, 5]
}

### 15. Update Password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "NewSecure123"
}
